#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install Qiskit Code Assistant {#install-qiskit-code-assistant}"
msgstr "تثبيت مساعد كود Qiskit {#install-qiskit-code-assistant}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Learn how to install, configure, and use any of Qiskit Code Assistant models"
" on your local machine.\n"
msgstr ""
"تعلّم كيفية تثبيت أي من نماذج مساعد كود Qiskit وتهيئتها واستخدامها على جهازك"
" المحلي.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Download from the Hugging Face website\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Download from the Hugging Face website\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Follow these steps to download any Qiskit Code Assistant-related model from "
"the Hugging Face website:\n"
msgstr ""
"اتّبع هذه الخطوات لتنزيل أي نموذج مرتبط بمساعد كود Qiskit من موقع Hugging "
"Face:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Navigate to the desired Qiskit model page on Hugging Face.\n"
msgstr "انتقل إلى صفحة نموذج Qiskit المطلوب على Hugging Face.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Go to the **Files and Versions** tab and download the safetensors or GGUF "
"model files.\n"
msgstr ""
"اذهب إلى تبويب **Files and Versions** ونزِّل ملفات نموذج safetensors أو "
"GGUF.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "</AccordionItem>\n"
msgstr "</AccordionItem>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<AccordionItem title=\"Download using the Hugging Face CLI\">\n"
msgstr "<AccordionItem title=\"Download using the Hugging Face CLI\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To download any of the available Qiskit Code Assistant models using the "
"Hugging Face CLI, follow these steps:\n"
msgstr ""
"لتنزيل أي من نماذج مساعد كود Qiskit المتاحة باستخدام Hugging Face CLI، اتّبع"
" الخطوات التالية:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install the [Hugging Face "
"CLI](https://huggingface.co/docs/huggingface_hub/main/en/guides/cli)\n"
msgstr ""
"ثبِّت [Hugging Face "
"CLI](https://huggingface.co/docs/huggingface_hub/main/en/guides/cli)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Log in to your Hugging Face account\n"
msgstr "سجِّل دخولك إلى حساب Hugging Face الخاص بك\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"    huggingface-cli login\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```\n"
"    huggingface-cli login\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Download the model you prefer from the previous list\n"
msgstr "نزِّل النموذج الذي تفضله من القائمة السابقة\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"    huggingface-cli download <HF REPO NAME> <MODEL PATH> --local-dir <LOCAL PATH>\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```\n"
"    huggingface-cli download <HF REPO NAME> <MODEL PATH> --local-dir <LOCAL PATH>\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<AccordionItem title=\"Manually deploy the Qiskit Code Assistant models in "
"local through Ollama\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<AccordionItem title=\"Manually deploy the Qiskit Code Assistant models in "
"local through Ollama\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"There are multiple ways to deploy and interact with the downloaded Qiskit "
"Code Assistant model. This guide demonstrates using "
"[Ollama](https://ollama.com) as follows: either with the [Ollama "
"application](#using-the-ollama-application) by using the Hugging Face Hub "
"integration or local model, or with the [`llama-cpp-python` package](#use-"
"llama-cpp-python).\n"
msgstr ""
"ثمة طرق متعددة لنشر نموذج مساعد كود Qiskit المنزَّل والتفاعل معه. يوضح هذا "
"الدليل استخدام [Ollama](https://ollama.com) على النحو التالي: إما مع [تطبيق "
"Ollama](#using-the-ollama-application) باستخدام تكامل Hugging Face Hub أو "
"النموذج المحلي، أو مع [حزمة `llama-cpp-python`](#use-llama-cpp-python).\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Using the Ollama application {#using-the-ollama-application}"
msgstr "استخدام تطبيق Ollama {#using-the-ollama-application}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Ollama application provides a simple solution to run the LLMs locally. "
"It is easy to use, with a CLI that makes the whole setup process, model "
"management, and interaction fairly straightforward. It’s ideal for quick "
"experimentation and for users that want fewer technical details to handle.\n"
msgstr ""
"يوفر تطبيق Ollama حلًّا بسيطًا لتشغيل نماذج LLM محليًا. وهو سهل الاستخدام، "
"مع واجهة سطر أوامر تجعل عملية الإعداد الكاملة وإدارة النماذج والتفاعل معها "
"أمرًا مباشرًا. وهو مثالي للتجريب السريع للمستخدمين الذين يريدون التعامل مع "
"تفاصيل تقنية أقل.\n"

#. type: Title #####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install Ollama {#install-ollama}"
msgstr "تثبيت Ollama {#install-ollama}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Download the [Ollama application](https://ollama.com/download)\n"
msgstr "نزِّل [تطبيق Ollama](https://ollama.com/download)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install the downloaded file\n"
msgstr "ثبِّت الملف المنزَّل\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Launch the installed Ollama application\n"
msgstr "شغِّل تطبيق Ollama المثبَّت\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Admonition type=\"info\">\n"
"        The application is running successfully when the Ollama icon appears in the desktop menu bar. You can also verify the service is running by going to `http://localhost:11434/`.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Admonition type=\"info\">\n"
"        يعمل التطبيق بنجاح عندما تظهر أيقونة Ollama في شريط قوائم سطح المكتب. يمكنك أيضًا التحقق من أن الخدمة تعمل بالانتقال إلى `http://localhost:11434/`.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Try Ollama in your terminal and start running models. For example:\n"
msgstr "جرِّب Ollama في طرفيتك وابدأ تشغيل النماذج. على سبيل المثال:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"    ollama run hf.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```\n"
"    ollama run hf.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Title #####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up Ollama using the Hugging Face Hub integration {#set-up-ollama-using-"
"the-hugging-face-hub-integration}"
msgstr ""
"إعداد Ollama باستخدام تكامل Hugging Face Hub {#set-up-ollama-using-the-"
"hugging-face-hub-integration}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The [Ollama/Hugging Face Hub "
"integration](https://huggingface.co/docs/hub/ollama) provides a way to "
"interact with models hosted on the Hugging Face Hub without needing to "
"create a new modelfile nor manually downloading the GGUF or safetensors "
"files. The default `template` and `params` files are already included for "
"the model on the Hugging Face Hub.\n"
msgstr ""
"يوفر [تكامل Ollama/Hugging Face Hub](https://huggingface.co/docs/hub/ollama)"
" طريقةً للتفاعل مع النماذج المستضافة على Hugging Face Hub دون الحاجة إلى "
"إنشاء modelfile جديد أو تنزيل ملفات GGUF أو safetensors يدويًا. ملفات "
"`template` و`params` الافتراضية مدرجة بالفعل للنموذج على Hugging Face Hub.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Make sure the Ollama application is running.\n"
msgstr "تأكد من أن تطبيق Ollama يعمل.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Go the desired model page, and copy the URL. For example, "
"https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF.\n"
msgstr ""
"انتقل إلى صفحة النموذج المطلوب وانسخ الرابط. على سبيل المثال، "
"https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "From your terminal, run the command:\n"
msgstr "من طرفيتك، نفِّذ الأمر:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can use the `hf.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit` model or any of the "
"other currently recommended GGUF official models `hf.co/Qiskit/mistral-"
"small-3.2-24b-qiskit-GGUF` or `hf.co/Qiskit/granite-3.3-8b-qiskit-GGUF`.\n"
msgstr ""
"يمكنك استخدام نموذج `hf.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit` أو أي من النماذج"
" الرسمية الحالية الأخرى الموصى بها بتنسيق GGUF `hf.co/Qiskit/mistral-"
"small-3.2-24b-qiskit-GGUF` أو `hf.co/Qiskit/granite-3.3-8b-qiskit-GGUF`.\n"

#. type: Title #####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up Ollama with a manually downloaded Qiskit Code Assistant GGUF model "
"{#set-up-ollama-with-a-manually-downloaded-qiskit-code-assistant-gguf-model}"
msgstr ""
"إعداد Ollama مع نموذج GGUF لمساعد كود Qiskit المنزَّل يدويًا {#set-up-"
"ollama-with-a-manually-downloaded-qiskit-code-assistant-gguf-model}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you have manually downloaded a GGUF model such as "
"https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF and you want to "
"experiment with different templates and parameters, you can follow these "
"steps to load it into your local Ollama application.\n"
msgstr ""
"إن كنت قد نزّلت نموذج GGUF يدويًا مثل "
"https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF وتريد تجريب "
"قوالب ومعاملات مختلفة، يمكنك اتّباع هذه الخطوات لتحميله في تطبيق Ollama "
"المحلي.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create a `Modelfile` entering the following content and be sure to update "
"`<PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>` to the actual path of your downloaded model.\n"
msgstr ""
"أنشئ `Modelfile` بإدخال المحتوى التالي وتأكد من تحديث `<PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>` "
"إلى المسار الفعلي للنموذج المنزَّل.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"    FROM <PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>\n"
"    TEMPLATE \"\"\"{{ if .System }}\n"
"    System:\n"
"    {{ .System }}\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```\n"
"    FROM <PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>\n"
"    TEMPLATE \"\"\"{{ if .System }}\n"
"    System:\n"
"    {{ .System }}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    {{ end }}{{ if .Prompt }}Question:\n"
"    {{ .Prompt }}\n"
msgstr ""
"    {{ end }}{{ if .Prompt }}Question:\n"
"    {{ .Prompt }}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    {{ end }}Answer:\n"
"    ```\n"
"    \"\"\"\n"
msgstr ""
"    {{ end }}Answer:\n"
"    ```\n"
"    \"\"\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    PARAMETER stop \"Question:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"Answer:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"System:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"```\"\n"
msgstr ""
"    PARAMETER stop \"Question:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"Answer:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"System:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"```\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    PARAMETER temperature 0\n"
"    PARAMETER top_k 1\n"
msgstr ""
"    PARAMETER temperature 0\n"
"    PARAMETER top_k 1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "    ```\n"
msgstr "    ```\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Run the following command to create a custom model instance based on the "
"`Modelfile`.\n"
msgstr "نفِّذ الأمر التالي لإنشاء مثيل نموذج مخصص استنادًا إلى `Modelfile`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"    ollama create Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit -f ./path-to-model-file\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```\n"
"    ollama create Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit -f ./path-to-model-file\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"        This process may take some time for Ollama to read the model file, initialize the model instance, and configure it according to the specifications provided.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"        قد تستغرق هذه العملية بعض الوقت حتى يقرأ Ollama ملف النموذج ويُهيئ مثيل النموذج ويُعدَّه وفقًا للمواصفات المقدَّمة.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title #####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Run the Qiskit Code Assistant model manually downloaded in Ollama"
msgstr "تشغيل نموذج مساعد كود Qiskit المنزَّل يدويًا في Ollama"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After the `Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit` model has been set up in Ollama, run "
"the following command to launch the model and interact with it in the "
"terminal (in chat mode).\n"
msgstr ""
"بعد إعداد نموذج `Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit` في Ollama، نفِّذ الأمر التالي "
"لتشغيل النموذج والتفاعل معه في الطرفية (في وضع المحادثة).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "from llama_cpp import Llama\n"
msgstr "from llama_cpp import Llama\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "model_path = <PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>\n"
msgstr "model_path = <PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"model = Llama(\n"
"        model_path,\n"
"        seed=17,\n"
"        n_ctx=10000,\n"
"        n_gpu_layers=37, # to offload in gpu, but put 0 if all in cpu\n"
"    )\n"
msgstr ""
"model = Llama(\n"
"        model_path,\n"
"        seed=17,\n"
"        n_ctx=10000,\n"
"        n_gpu_layers=37, # to offload in gpu, but put 0 if all in cpu\n"
"    )\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"input = 'Generate a quantum circuit with 2 qubits'\n"
"raw_pred = model(input)[\"choices\"][0][\"text\"]\n"
msgstr ""
"input = 'Generate a quantum circuit with 2 qubits'\n"
"raw_pred = model(input)[\"choices\"][0][\"text\"]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"generation_kwargs = {\n"
"        \"max_tokens\": 512,\n"
"        \"echo\": False, # Echo the prompt in the output\n"
"        \"top_k\": 1\n"
"    }\n"
msgstr ""
"generation_kwargs = {\n"
"        \"max_tokens\": 512,\n"
"        \"echo\": False, # Echo the prompt in the output\n"
"        \"top_k\": 1\n"
"    }\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "raw_pred = model(input, **generation_kwargs)[\"choices\"][0][\"text\"]\n"
msgstr "raw_pred = model(input, **generation_kwargs)[\"choices\"][0][\"text\"]\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Use a local model file {#use-a-local-model-file}"
msgstr "Use a local model file {#use-a-local-model-file}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "llama-cli -m my_model.gguf -cnv\n"
msgstr "llama-cli -m my_model.gguf -cnv\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Or download and run a model directly from Hugging Face {#or-download-and-"
"run-a-model-directly-from-hugging-face}"
msgstr ""
"Or download and run a model directly from Hugging Face {#or-download-and-"
"run-a-model-directly-from-hugging-face}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "llama-cli -hf Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF -cnv\n"
msgstr "llama-cli -hf Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF -cnv\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "llama-server -hf Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF\n"
msgstr "llama-server -hf Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"llama-cli -hf Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF \\\n"
"  -p \"You are a friendly assistant.\" -cnv \\\n"
"  --temp 0.7 \\\n"
"  --top-k 50 \\\n"
"  --top-p 0.95 \\\n"
"  --repeat-penalty 1.1 \\\n"
"  --seed 42\n"
msgstr ""
"llama-cli -hf Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF \\\n"
"  -p \"You are a friendly assistant.\" -cnv \\\n"
"  --temp 0.7 \\\n"
"  --top-k 50 \\\n"
"  --top-p 0.95 \\\n"
"  --repeat-penalty 1.1 \\\n"
"  --seed 42\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"models:\n"
"  - name: Qiskit Code Assistant\n"
"    provider: ollama\n"
"    model: mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit\n"
"    apiBase: http://localhost:11434\n"
msgstr ""
"models:\n"
"  - name: Qiskit Code Assistant\n"
"    provider: ollama\n"
"    model: mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit\n"
"    apiBase: http://localhost:11434\n"

